        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "9112b2b0523bf54206cf9eaa2f8bdc5e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "年初，澳网。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f340bde5bccefbb9855aeb31785f5e273084d8cf83538c849257e6424d7d6fba",
      "words_sha256": "6ef5ff708c9d0b43346c832792ccfdb856ab988f4a4774206105dc4daabf9dcf",
      "words_path": "voice_03.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6d7a00e4219a237cf92ad76efaaae617",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "熟悉的胜利，开始变难。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "792a4805b8771099c2b35b40e104923428519d6e2cb20877e56371ec36816a0d",
      "words_sha256": "580cc5dc1160b5d218d8a4ebd5c647450c4bc497041d7262d6316bed85580f31",
      "words_path": "voice_04.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "dd91c77073b269d35116f690a31bae5c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "迈阿密，她先赢一盘六比一，却被里内特逆转。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8c0463b21f5a5a69e0e169c18130a994aaf9f71506a5577018d413bdeb32d88a",
      "words_sha256": "496994a9e684d9cc6007760e2288476e816eb5c53d96c3e1ac82d647a2d26927",
      "words_path": "voice_06.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "35fe9ebeebb3f8306cb57525b2eba718",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "七十三站首战连胜，就此终结。四天后，她与费塞特结束合作。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e9b5060221583000de9f5d2a0ca3841dccc8c7f0dd623ecbb919a2c13d4db618",
      "words_sha256": "0b4452c544c8fcb9a09120d456f6ebc2e2a733f0cfad9a17e1a4167a44d251fd",
      "words_path": "voice_07.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5c722e2198aa2ce0c1858563ee1fc6a4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "接下来，是她四次夺冠的巴黎。五月三十一日，二十五岁生日，她却止步第四轮。赛后，她谈到紧张。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a215d31269f50a36b61d32adddab00178fda8dc4429aeebe9cf3187c39de9f9f",
      "words_sha256": "bb99a69f6cdf251bc51944a1d0714f03394218a8eb0980d3765f8c4310b05607",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0d45b704f70ab9066d08f72643edfc99",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "红土没有冠军，草地也没能守住奖杯。对伊埃拉，首盘两个盘点错过，止步温网第三轮。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "fdb2970c63a8fd91fa328bae9a41b906fa70ffcd69d77226e144f526df568efc",
      "words_sha256": "484849aeb3ec999767e27a444561d89081ca50a70a9ce9468097b4e349a24692",
      "words_path": "voice_11.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0bf835f9d43461976ef0c8e96d372fdc",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "但这一年，也有重新找回自己的时候。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f797e971a79c60700d32ef5491f4f886e2bdbdf873ff48d44fcacb4e9b5e0368",
      "words_sha256": "a5c78b3ba96fcf3b423c1309aeb0ca584aaf319d73da8e30237b0e136e61d843",
      "words_path": "voice_13.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "9beb033c5034823801beeccd081c2b15",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "几天后，多伦多决赛，她战胜莱巴金娜，拿下今年唯一的巡回赛单打冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c866c8e7f5a51432acd1d73912fe6af392b4d0d7f2bc875b35858d3edc7b58df",
      "words_sha256": "c5103712c41c36b3a38e98bfb2e2d01c402e642d4c313bc4dbec18db2a1e3063",
      "words_path": "voice_15.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5583ce815aa1875c7a8099ebcaf7d8f1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可这次回升，没能一路延续到纽约。对郑钦文，首盘五比零领先。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "bfb914aa256fe6377276a158b967ed6180d256ce61f573f7b5917a7cda606ca8",
      "words_sha256": "28580ae9f777a98f3c6e74409ed043a9ee274f4ff45160eb9aac8679d3d0663f",
      "words_path": "voice_16.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "cfa170a8491f2b8b7855c3007c465d23",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "距离拿下这一盘，只差一局。随后却连丢七局，最终止步第四轮。四站大满贯，最好成绩仍是年初澳网四分之一决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d369990abe6b3e0893ba60cca61d01374f0893438b2ceb78a197c72f7aa63270",
      "words_sha256": "14b87d99d729d01ae3a2a9b68e7360a556d4186ea690d4aedb446a861788d3d1",
      "words_path": "voice_18.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1f269a6b3b8ab4b5fd349c292958790f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "走到武汉，她还没有停下。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "44575f5e536cb07809fdc591a5a91cc55b95e86aa38e15c2368d48e379f0132b",
      "words_sha256": "2babb03e06d017b9e9900a9e2ff0866687d2d248f4b0b275a3c0ff1c18ed13ac",
      "words_path": "voice_19.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b2e1c7dfc9bec10316668115f270e339",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她还在争取年终资格。首盘五比三，两个盘点，依然没能拿下。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "499149d9af50bda60ac57f0658dae0e5b9c95421f776335fadfc9aa94596ff8a",
      "words_sha256": "accf5f179efd57a4276d2ef9e179d64abab69a5331b4a89220daa516a86fc5ed",
      "words_path": "voice_20.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "52a8549473d8b20daafffe8b1c0bcbea",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "比赛中，腿伤需要处理。她坚持打完，最后五比七、一比六落败。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c0c9a8f26e4aa13e92c8fb610761fc823e9b8872574f6cc3a347a771982b700b",
      "words_sha256": "fe6c095d39612f26087f4acd27e35da34c2460ece38c8d14622ed39c7c741143",
      "words_path": "voice_21.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b58420921f1fbadc64304d49e88ff211",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三天后，她退出宁波。左大腿的问题，已经持续数周。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b0245843c3272efa4f59dee75db6793fdb9555e4eed4c1ea410302802253d9bf",
      "words_sha256": "bf85a1447305c5b07f599021d301522d9f03e25fde07e0c9db67b2634cf695af",
      "words_path": "voice_22.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3e8e09c4b40ebbf5b5ff1c116fa8bb74",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "接着，她宣布结束赛季，把时间留给更充分的休息与恢复。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "6d206829c0e054728ed4fb23f01e25d139e89e94c7c75f060a02dafd0530c2a1",
      "words_sha256": "ab018c24e1d13d8254288d6483d4301d3cd977eface8bdbcba560e8c4f883cee",
      "words_path": "voice_23.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "01d3403b390c5a3a37a362d72a28738c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她也肯定了自己的努力，为下半年的进步感到自豪。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "7f60a21dd5e062269491ebe8eeaf06b883a8a904dac01fbfd0b8c7d063009fe9",
      "words_sha256": "46f7b4cdbb11c6d0de56f8fe122f5294e2c3f8883e6b06e15b639b6619dd2ae3",
      "words_path": "voice_24.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "652b1df7370a231276979c0515c6988b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这一年留下了失利，也留下了一座奖杯。等她恢复健康，你最期待她在哪片球场，找回自己？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_outro.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "135d932a2c25d41f913c242edc16af3d5de408094ee0213c571c4ddfdcccef0a",
      "words_sha256": "10daf5ca2990037987ff9002a227b5014d4fe6094b571a22719aa7d5629db9ac",
      "words_path": "voice_outro.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    }
  ]
}
